# Claude Code (agent memory, local settings), in every `.claude` folder at any depth. Only the root
# `.claude/rules/` is tracked: the repository's rules (versioning). `**/.claude/*` rather than
# `.claude`, or git could not re-include the directory; not `.claude/*`, which matches the root only.
**/.claude/*
!/.claude/rules/
# Agent memory on its own, so it stays ignored if the line above is ever narrowed: it is a symlink
# into the private notes repository (lt-memory). No trailing slash, or the symlink is not matched.
**/.claude/agent-memory

